Mon Oct 26 23:45:00 UTC 2026 - ahjolinna <ahjolinna@yahoo.com>

- Never report a blank PackageKit error. An empty zypper failure now
  says the command produced no output and includes the exit code.
- Leave the offline-update stub. PreparedUpgrade invalidation is
  packagekit-qt after packagekitd drops off the bus.

